@startuml
scale 1.5
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

[*] --> ACTIVE : User Account Created

ACTIVE --> LOCKED : 3 Failed Login / OTP Attempts
LOCKED --> ACTIVE : Automatic Lockout Expiration (e.g. 24h)
LOCKED --> ACTIVE : Admin Manual Unlock\n(Grants Password-Only Bypass Window)

ACTIVE --> DISABLED : Admin Disables Account
DISABLED --> ACTIVE : Admin Re-enables Account

ACTIVE --> [*]
DISABLED --> [*]
@enduml
